{"pages":[{"h":792,"segs":[["T H E E P I C M OV E M E N T 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,600.33389999999997,9,false],["THE EPIC",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,312.22000000000003,116.00059999999996,80,false],["MOVEMENT",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,360.86000000000001,176.00059999999996,80,false],["REACHING ASIAN-AMERICANS",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,432.77999999999997,194.10059999999999,20,false],["leaders of secular Asian American organizations.",369.20000000000005,224.88939999999991,554.69000000000017,237.29139999999995,9,false],["Find a person of peace. Invest time in a leader or",369.20000000000005,250.88939999999991,549.27100000000007,263.30039999999997,9,false],["leaders that are committed to the Epic Movement",369.20000000000005,263.88939999999991,557.37200000000007,276.29139999999995,9,false],["vision and who desire to launch a movement within",369.20000000000005,276.88939999999991,564.19400000000019,289.29139999999995,9,false],["their community. Invite them to attend an epic",369.20000000000005,289.88939999999997,545.78000000000009,302.29139999999995,9,false],["movement student conference.",369.20000000000005,302.88939999999997,487.12700000000007,315.29139999999995,9,false],["EPICMOVEMENT.COM",154.52430000000001,323.61399999999998,249.9443,344.154,20,false],["The Epic Movement was launched as a response to",145.40000000000001,363.52969999999999,337.82900000000006,375.93169999999998,9,false],["the rapidly changing campus population in the United",145.40000000000001,376.52969999999999,349.5200000000001,388.93169999999998,9,false],["States. As more and more Asian American students",145.40000000000001,389.52969999999999,339.79100000000017,401.93169999999998,9,false],["come to campus, they are increasingly immersing",145.40000000000001,402.52969999999999,332.77100000000007,414.93169999999998,9,false],["themselves in an ethnic student subculture. If we are",145.40000000000001,415.52969999999999,345.43399999999997,427.93169999999998,9,false],["to reach these students, we cannot rely on traditional",145.40000000000001,428.52969999999999,346.03700000000015,440.93169999999998,9,false],["means of ministry. The challenge of this generation",145.40000000000001,441.52969999999999,339.49400000000014,453.93169999999998,9,false],["is to believe God to do something radical, something",145.40000000000001,454.52969999999999,342.05900000000008,466.93169999999998,9,false],["different, whatever is necessary to give every Asian",145.40000000000001,467.52969999999999,338.67500000000007,479.93169999999998,9,false],["American student a chance to hear the gospel and",145.40000000000001,480.52969999999999,333.10400000000004,492.93169999999998,9,false],["respond to Christ.",145.40000000000001,493.52969999999999,213.935,505.93169999999998,9,false],["Do evangelism among Asian American students. Use",369.20000000000005,328.88939999999997,565.51390000000004,341.30039999999997,9,false],["contextualized Asian-American evangelism tools (For",369.20000000000005,341.88939999999997,574.202,354.29139999999995,9,false],["some ideas, see the Epic Movement Filing Cabinet),",369.20000000000005,354.88939999999997,564.97700000000009,367.29139999999995,9,false],["engage in both initiative and relational evangelism",369.20000000000005,367.88939999999997,560.40500000000009,380.29139999999995,9,false],["and model & train your key leaders in effective",369.20000000000005,380.88939999999997,544.54700000000014,393.29139999999995,9,false],["witnessing.",369.20000000000005,393.88940000000002,412.94000000000005,406.29140000000001,9,false],["Disciple your leaders. Equip your leaders to lead the",369.20000000000005,419.88940000000002,563.52680000000009,432.30040000000002,9,false],["Epic Movement ministry themselves and invite them",369.20000000000005,432.88940000000002,570.9530000000002,445.29140000000001,9,false],["into your life as you mentor them in all aspects.",369.20000000000005,445.88940000000002,547.30100000000016,458.29140000000001,9,false],["CONNECTING TO EPIC",369.20000000000005,478.27440000000001,464.62000000000006,498.81440000000003,20,false],["You can learn more about Epic Movement by visiting",369.20000000000005,497.88940000000002,569.43200000000024,510.29140000000001,9,false],["the Epic Movement website: epicmovement.com",369.20000000000005,510.88940000000002,554.0317,523.29140000000007,9,false],["Epic has been formed as a contextualized approach",145.40000000000001,519.52970000000005,338.8010000000001,531.93169999999998,9,false],["to reach the growing number of Asian-American",145.40000000000001,532.52970000000005,328.97300000000007,544.93169999999998,9,false],["students. There are Epic ministries across the",145.40000000000001,545.52970000000005,319.76600000000008,557.93169999999998,9,false],["country.",145.40000000000001,558.52970000000005,176.846,570.93169999999998,9,false],["For Coaching or to get a student connected to Epic,",369.20000000000005,536.88940000000002,561.81800000000021,549.29139999999995,9,false],["email Darrin Mabuni: darrin.mabuni@uscm.org",369.20000000000005,549.88940000000002,551.95240000000001,562.29139999999995,9,false],["5 WAYS TO LAUNCH AN EPIC MOVEMENT",145.40000000000001,590.91470000000004,323.84000000000003,611.4547,20,false],["Decode the campus. Familiarize yourself with",145.40000000000001,610.52970000000005,316.00310000000002,622.94069999999999,9,false],["Asian cultures. Learn about the demographics of",145.40000000000001,623.52970000000005,329.28800000000012,635.93169999999998,9,false],["the campus (e.g. which Asian American cultures are",145.40000000000001,636.52970000000005,341.97800000000007,648.93169999999998,9,false],["represented, how many students are there), find out if",145.40000000000001,649.52970000000005,348.18800000000005,661.93169999999998,9,false],["there are Asian American churches nearby and which",145.40000000000001,662.52970000000005,348.82700000000011,674.93169999999998,9,false],["student groups exist.",145.40000000000001,675.52970000000005,224.39300000000003,687.93169999999998,9,false],["Build relational bridges. Connect with local Asian",145.40000000000001,701.52970000000005,332.30130000000003,713.94069999999999,9,false],["American pastors, leaders of existing ministries and",145.40000000000001,714.52970000000005,342.65300000000013,726.93169999999998,9,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612},{"h":792,"ocr":false,"w":612,"segs":[["2. Build Relationships. Professors often have few",370.20000000000005,46.434899999999857,554.96100000000001,58.836899999999901,9,false],["Christian friends on campus; your encouragement",370.20000000000005,59.434899999999857,560.91000000000008,71.836899999999901,9,false],["may make a real difference in their life.",370.20000000000005,72.434899999999857,517.35000000000014,84.836899999999901,9,false],["I could start Campus Crusade for Christ all over",148.047,100.43489999999986,331.29600000000005,112.8368999999999,9,false],["again, I would begin by including ministry with",146.40000000000001,113.43489999999986,328.37100000000021,125.8368999999999,9,false],["professors.” — Bill Bright",146.40000000000001,126.43489999999986,243.32999999999998,138.8368999999999,9,false],["3. Involve Profs In What You Are Already Doing.",370.20000000000005,98.434899999999857,552.13500000000022,110.8368999999999,9,false],["Professors would love to meet committed Christian",370.20000000000005,111.43489999999986,565.43700000000013,123.8368999999999,9,false],["students; some may be willing to speak at meetings or",370.20000000000005,124.43489999999986,572.67300000000023,136.8368999999999,9,false],["help with outreaches.",370.20000000000005,137.43489999999986,451.88400000000007,149.8368999999999,9,false],["WHAT DOES FACULTY COMMONS DO?",146.40000000000001,158.81989999999996,310.72000000000003,179.35989999999993,20,false],["For more than 25 years we have pioneered faculty",146.40000000000001,178.43489999999986,334.17600000000004,190.8368999999999,9,false],["ministry under the name Christian Leadership",146.40000000000001,191.43489999999986,323.95200000000011,203.8368999999999,9,false],["Ministries. We are transitioning to our new name,",146.40000000000001,204.43489999999986,335.39100000000002,216.8368999999999,9,false],["Faculty Commons. We are excited about this change,",146.40000000000001,217.43489999999986,345.84000000000015,229.8368999999999,9,false],["as we believe this new identity will better position",146.40000000000001,230.43489999999986,336.02100000000013,242.8368999999999,9,false],["us to minister to both professors and students in the",146.40000000000001,243.43489999999986,343.48200000000008,255.8368999999999,9,false],["academy.",146.40000000000001,256.43489999999986,181.59900000000002,268.8368999999999,9,false],["CONNECTING TO FACULTY COMMONS",370.20000000000005,169.81989999999996,534.94000000000005,190.35989999999993,20,false],["You can find more helpful information at our website:",370.20000000000005,189.43489999999986,572.45700000000011,201.8368999999999,9,false],["www.facultycommons.com",370.20000000000005,202.43489999999986,473.89800000000002,214.8368999999999,9,false],["You can reach Faculty Commons at 972-516-0516 or",370.20000000000005,228.43489999999986,567.84900000000016,240.8368999999999,9,false],["by emailing: peter.culver@uscm.org",370.20000000000005,241.43489999999986,506.53099999999995,253.8368999999999,9,false],["On campuses all over the world we help Christian",146.40000000000001,282.43489999999997,333.95100000000019,294.83689999999996,9,false],["faculty gather as a “transformed minority” of men",146.40000000000001,295.43489999999997,336.57000000000005,307.83689999999996,9,false],["and women who love the academy, who find the",146.40000000000001,308.43489999999997,325.34700000000009,320.83689999999996,9,false],["person and works of Jesus of Nazareth to be satisfying",146.40000000000001,321.43489999999997,351.58200000000011,333.83689999999996,9,false],["and true, and who look to Him as the beautiful hope",146.40000000000001,334.43489999999997,340.83600000000013,346.83689999999996,9,false],["for the world.",146.40000000000001,347.43489999999997,197.47500000000002,359.83689999999996,9,false],["We dream of the day when there are movements",146.40000000000001,373.43489999999997,328.38900000000001,385.83689999999996,9,false],["of Christian professors on every campus, circles",146.40000000000001,386.43489999999997,328.0920000000001,398.83689999999996,9,false],["of professors willing to wrestle with the ever-",146.40000000000001,399.43489999999997,318.06600000000003,411.83689999999996,9,false],["challenging question, “As a Christian, what should I",146.40000000000001,412.43489999999997,341.53800000000007,424.83689999999996,9,false],["do in the academy?”",146.40000000000001,425.43489999999997,222.423,437.83689999999996,9,false],["HOW DO WE ACCOMPLISH THIS?",146.40000000000001,455.81989999999996,289.26000000000005,476.35989999999998,20,false],["Through our fulltime staff of nearly 100, and in",146.40000000000001,475.43489999999997,323.32200000000012,487.83689999999996,9,false],["partnership with many other USCM staff and",146.40000000000001,488.43490000000003,318.48900000000003,500.83690000000001,9,false],["volunteers, we help professors:",146.40000000000001,501.43490000000003,263.42700000000002,513.83690000000001,9,false],["T H E",43.841200000000001,586.39089999999999,57.071200000000005,601.1259,7,false],["E P I C",43.841200000000001,566.69290000000001,57.071200000000005,583.41589999999997,7,false],["M OV E M E N T 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,563.71789999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,527.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,539.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,553.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,565.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,592.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,604.83690000000001,9,false],["Grow in their faith journey in Christ and become",164.40000000000001,527.43489999999997,348.97200000000009,539.83690000000001,9,false],["leaders to emulate;",164.40000000000001,540.43489999999997,236.13,552.83690000000001,9,false],["Integrate their personal faith with their teaching,",164.40000000000001,553.43489999999997,350.89800000000014,565.83690000000001,9,false],["research, publishing and service as a holistic",164.40000000000001,566.43489999999997,333.07800000000009,578.83690000000001,9,false],["endeavor",164.40000000000001,579.43489999999997,199.73400000000001,591.83690000000001,9,false],["Include a Christian worldview in discussions",164.40000000000001,592.43489999999997,335.7600000000001,604.83690000000001,9,false],["throughout the campus community and the",164.40000000000001,605.43489999999997,328.83900000000006,617.83690000000001,9,false],["greater culture.",164.40000000000001,618.43489999999997,223.125,630.83690000000001,9,false],["HOW YOU CAN HELP",146.40000000000001,650.81989999999996,235.04000000000002,671.35990000000004,20,false],["1. Cultivate A Vision For A Student-Faculty Ministry.",146.40000000000001,670.43489999999997,347.65800000000002,682.83690000000001,9,false],["What would your campus be like if Christian",146.40000000000001,683.43489999999997,315.38400000000013,695.83690000000001,9,false],["professors and students were united in reaching the",146.40000000000001,696.43489999999997,342.77100000000013,708.83690000000001,9,false],["university?",146.40000000000001,709.43489999999997,189.53700000000003,721.83690000000001,9,false]]},{"segs":[["which it speaks.",370.20000000000005,33.434899999999857,430.73400000000004,45.836899999999901,9,false],["8. Our salvation is wholly a work of God’s free grace",370.20000000000005,72.434899999999857,563.9430000000001,84.836899999999901,9,false],["and is not the work, in whole or in part, of human",370.20000000000005,85.434899999999857,555.21300000000019,97.836899999999901,9,false],["works or goodness or religious ceremony. God",370.20000000000005,98.434899999999857,543.89100000000008,110.8368999999999,9,false],["imputes His righteousness to those who put their",370.20000000000005,111.43489999999986,556.65300000000013,123.8368999999999,9,false],["faith in Christ alone for their salvation, and thereby all",370.20000000000005,124.43489999999986,576.00300000000016,136.8368999999999,9,false],["justifies them in His sight.",370.20000000000005,137.43489999999986,469.42500000000007,149.8368999999999,9,false],["The greatest answer to your prayers for this initial",370.20000000000005,189.43489999999986,560.32500000000016,201.8368999999999,9,false],["LAUNCHING THE MINISTRY",370.20000000000005,221.81989999999996,489.42000000000007,242.35989999999993,20,false],["Phew! That’s over. By-and-large it went pretty well.",370.20000000000005,241.43489999999986,563.58300000000008,253.8368999999999,9,false],["But again, you are not just starting a Bible Study, you",370.20000000000005,254.43489999999986,568.32600000000002,266.8368999999999,9,false],["are launching a ministry and so here’s what you need",370.20000000000005,267.43489999999986,569.53200000000015,279.8368999999999,9,false],["to think about in light of this second objective.",370.20000000000005,280.43489999999997,544.70100000000002,292.83689999999996,9,false],["BEFORE EVERYONE LEAVES",370.20000000000005,316.91489999999999,459.90000000000009,332.31989999999996,15,false],["Before anyone heads out the door, make sure you have",370.20000000000005,332.43489999999997,573.58200000000011,344.83689999999996,9,false],["everyone’s contact information. Second, encourage",370.20000000000005,345.43489999999997,563.76300000000015,357.83689999999996,9,false],["them to bring out any Christian friends they may",370.20000000000005,358.43489999999997,554.74500000000012,370.83689999999996,9,false],["know to the next Bible Study. Last, cast a vision for",370.20000000000005,371.43489999999997,561.51300000000015,383.83689999999996,9,false],["what this Small Group could become. Let them know",370.20000000000005,384.43489999999997,570.36000000000013,396.83689999999996,9,false],["that on some campuses student ministries can have",370.20000000000005,397.43489999999997,565.47300000000007,409.83689999999996,9,false],["5-6-700 people involved. Help them to see that this",370.20000000000005,410.43489999999997,562.66500000000019,422.83689999999996,9,false],["isn’t just a Bible Study but rather they are involved at",370.20000000000005,423.43489999999997,570.1260000000002,435.83689999999996,9,false],["the ground floor of what could be a major movement",370.20000000000005,436.43489999999997,567.29100000000017,448.83689999999996,9,false],["of God on the campus.",370.20000000000005,449.43489999999997,453.78300000000007,461.83689999999996,9,false],["T H E",43.841200000000001,586.3098,57.071200000000005,601.04480000000001,7,false],["E P I C",43.841200000000001,566.6117999999999,57.071200000000005,583.33479999999997,7,false],["M OV E M E N T 3",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,563.63679999999999,9,false],["LEADERSHIP ANYONE? . . . ANYONE?",370.20000000000005,485.91489999999999,488.77499999999998,501.31990000000002,15,false],["During the first Small Group meeting did anyone",370.20000000000005,501.43490000000003,554.48400000000015,513.83690000000001,9,false],["strike you as someone who could help give leadership,",370.20000000000005,514.43489999999997,573.65400000000011,526.83690000000001,9,false],["even if it’s simply making calls or putting up flyers?",370.20000000000005,527.43489999999997,562.98000000000013,539.83690000000001,9,false],["Usually there are at least a couple students willing to",370.20000000000005,540.43489999999997,569.45100000000002,552.83690000000001,9,false],["share some degree of ownership for the group.",370.20000000000005,553.43489999999997,544.2600000000001,565.83690000000001,9,false],["If you’ve been able to identify a few leaders you can do",370.20000000000005,579.43489999999997,573.64500000000021,591.83690000000001,9,false],["one of two things. First, you might pull them aside at",370.20000000000005,592.43489999999997,567.84000000000015,604.83690000000001,9,false],["the end of the first Bible Study. As people are heading",370.20000000000005,605.43489999999997,570.53100000000018,617.83690000000001,9,false],["out the door ask them to stay behind and suggest going",370.20000000000005,618.43489999999997,575.79600000000016,630.83690000000001,9,false],["out for some coffee to get their feedback and input on",370.20000000000005,631.43489999999997,570.63000000000011,643.83690000000001,9,false],["how things went.",370.20000000000005,644.43489999999997,434.91000000000008,656.83690000000001,9,false],["he sole basis of our beliefs is the Bible, God’s infallible",146.40000000000001,644.43489999999997,349.476,656.83690000000001,9,false],["written Word, the 66 books of the Old and New",146.40000000000001,657.43489999999997,323.27700000000004,669.83690000000001,9,false],["Testaments. We believe it was uniquely, verbally",146.40000000000001,670.43489999999997,329.52300000000002,682.83690000000001,9,false],["and fully inspired by the Holy Spirit and that it was",146.40000000000001,683.43489999999997,339.00000000000011,695.83690000000001,9,false],["written without error in the original manuscripts. It",146.40000000000001,696.43489999999997,343.28400000000011,708.83690000000001,9,false],["is the supreme and final authority in all matters on",146.40000000000001,709.43489999999997,337.43400000000008,721.83690000000001,9,false],["A second possibility is to call these potential leaders",370.20000000000005,670.43489999999997,567.13800000000015,682.83690000000001,9,false],["and set up a separate meeting (sometime before",370.20000000000005,683.43489999999997,550.74000000000001,695.83690000000001,9,false],["the next Bible study). Just tell them you felt their",370.20000000000005,696.43489999999997,555.07800000000009,708.83690000000001,9,false],["presence added a lot to the group and you’d like to get",370.20000000000005,709.43489999999997,570.31500000000005,721.83690000000001,9,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792},{"h":792,"w":612,"segs":[["together to get their input and feedback.",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,297.77999999999997,45.836899999999901,9,false],["doing it, but disciple more.",146.40000000000001,59.434899999999857,246.91200000000003,71.836899999999901,9,false],["WHAT IS INVOLVED IN DISCIPLESHIP",146.40000000000001,91.819899999999961,306.13999999999999,112.35989999999993,20,false],["To explore the topic of discipleship fully is beyond the",146.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,349.8900000000001,123.8368999999999,9,false],["scope of this article. Several things are important to",146.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,341.81700000000012,136.8368999999999,9,false],["note as it relates to spiritual multiplication.",146.40000000000001,137.43489999999986,310.83000000000004,149.8368999999999,9,false],["SHARE YOUR FAITH",146.40000000000001,173.91489999999999,209.95500000000001,189.31989999999996,15,false],["In order to reproduce yourselves, you must be actively",146.40000000000001,189.43489999999986,350.69100000000014,201.8368999999999,9,false],["praying and seeking opportunities to share Christ",146.40000000000001,202.43489999999986,334.36500000000012,214.8368999999999,9,false],["with others. I always try to keep a copy or two of the",146.40000000000001,215.43489999999986,341.2050000000001,227.8368999999999,9,false],["Four Spiritual Laws with me wherever I go, so I am",146.40000000000001,228.43489999999986,338.7120000000001,240.8368999999999,9,false],["prepared. If I can’t get into a discussion about Christ,",146.40000000000001,241.43489999999986,346.41600000000011,253.8368999999999,9,false],["I can always hand someone a booklet and kindly ask",146.40000000000001,254.43489999999986,342.06900000000007,266.8368999999999,9,false],["them to read it over.",146.40000000000001,267.43489999999986,221.649,279.8368999999999,9,false],["DISCIPLE OTHERS IN HOW TO SHARE THEIR FAITH",146.40000000000001,303.91489999999999,309.70500000000004,319.31989999999996,15,false],["Critical to what Jesus modeled, and to the success",146.40000000000001,319.43489999999997,335.98500000000007,331.83689999999996,9,false],["of our math experiment, is that young Christians",146.40000000000001,332.43489999999997,330.57600000000014,344.83689999999996,9,false],["need to be shown how to communicate their faith to",146.40000000000001,345.43489999999997,342.66300000000012,357.83689999999996,9,false],["others. This keeps the reproduction going. To produce",146.40000000000001,358.43489999999997,350.69100000000009,370.83689999999996,9,false],["disciples who do not know how to share their faith is",146.40000000000001,371.43489999999997,344.7600000000001,383.83689999999996,9,false],["to end your spiritual family lineage.",146.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,280.59000000000009,396.83689999999996,9,false],["T H E",43.841200000000001,586.70589999999993,57.071200000000005,601.44090000000006,7,false],["E P I C",43.841200000000001,567.00790000000006,57.071200000000005,583.73090000000002,7,false],["M OV E M E N T 4",43.841200000000001,509.5,57.071200000000005,564.03290000000004,9,false]],"ocr":false},{"w":612,"h":792,"ocr":false,"segs":[["T H E",43.841200000000001,586.57979999999998,57.071200000000005,601.31479999999999,7,false],["E P I C",43.841200000000001,566.8818,57.071200000000005,583.60479999999995,7,false],["M OV E M E N T 5",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,563.90679999999998,9,false]]},{"segs":[["T H E",43.841200000000001,586.74189999999999,57.071200000000005,601.4769,7,false],["E P I C",43.841200000000001,567.04390000000001,57.071200000000005,583.76689999999996,7,false],["M OV E M E N T 6",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,564.06889999999999,9,false]],"ocr":false,"h":792,"w":612},{"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["T H E",43.841200000000001,586.33690000000001,57.071200000000005,601.07190000000003,7,false],["E P I C",43.841200000000001,566.63889999999992,57.071200000000005,583.36189999999999,7,false